{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider"}],"title":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B34ThemeButtonComponentTokensProviderC","symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebuttoncomponenttokensprovider"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A class which wraps all ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of buttons"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"button"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" objects like ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSButton","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"code":"AllButtonComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation to use.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Custom themes can use subclass of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and a